      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This work by Isaac Gantwerk Mayer is an adaptation of “National Brotherhood Week” (1965) by Tom Lehrer. Isaac notes that neither the English or Hebrew lyrics are direct translations of one another. A recording of Isaac performing the work was published to his Facebook page on 9 April 2024.</tei:p>
